This error typically occurs when there is an unexpected character in the JSON string, such as an HTML tag. It suggests that the JSON parser encountered an invalid character.

Please double-check the data you are trying to parse. Make sure it is a valid JSON string and does not contain any HTML tags or other non-JSON characters. If the data is coming from an API or external source, ensure that it is properly formatted. You might need to sanitize or validate the input before parsing it as JSON.

If you provide the problematic JSON string, I can help you identify the issue more specifically. ;;
